#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Loan Shark"
msgid "What the fuck are you...?"
msgstr "¿Quién mierda eres...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, sorry, I should've told you. I'm stronger than I look."
msgstr "Ah, lo lamento, debería haberles dicho. Soy más fuerte de lo que parezco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Loan Shark"
msgid "Dammit! You'll pay for this!"
msgstr "¡Maldita sea! ¡Pagarás por esto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Never heard that one before... Do people really still talk\\r\nlike that?"
msgstr "Nunca había escuchado eso antes... ¿La gente sigue hablando\\r\nasí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "(Okay, time to see how Shoko-san's doing.)"
msgstr "(Vale, es hora de ver como le va a Shoko-san.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Shoko"
msgid "Akiyama-san? What are you doing here?"
msgstr "¿Akiyama-san? ¿Qué haces aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, er..."
msgstr "Oh, eh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Shoko"
msgid "Wait a minute. Have you been following me?"
msgstr "Un momento. ¿Me has estado siguiendo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "No, I was just in the neighborhood collecting a debt. What\\r\nhave you been up to?"
msgstr "No, solo andaba por el vecindario recolectando una deuda. ¿Cómo\\r\nhas estado?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Shoko"
msgid "Me...? That doesn't really matter, does it? It has nothing\\r\nto do with you, after all."
msgstr "¿Yo...? Eso no importa, ¿no? No tiene nada que ver\\r\ncontigo, después de todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "Fair enough. By the way, did you figure out how to spend\\r\nthat million yen yet?"
msgstr "Está bien. ¿Por cierto, Ya sabes como gastarás\\r\nese millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Shoko"
msgid "No, not yet... Why? Are you curious?"
msgstr "No, aún no... ¿Por qué? ¿Tienes curiosidad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Not especially. I mean, I gave you that money. It's yours to\\r\ndo with as you please."
msgstr "No especialmente. Quiero decir, yo fui quien te dio el dinero. Es cosa tuya\\r\nlo que hagas con el."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Shoko"
msgid "Yes, well... I have someplace else I'd like to go, so if\\r\nyou'll excuse me..."
msgstr "Sí, bueno... Tengo un lugar donde ir, así que si\\r\nme perdonas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Akiyama"
msgid "(Someplace else she'd like to go? Where's she headed now?)"
msgstr "(¿Un lugar donde tiene que ir? ¿Dónde es que irá ahora?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "Fair enough. By the way, did you spend that million yen yet?"
msgstr "Está bien. ¿Por cierto, Ya gastaste ese millón de yenes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Shoko"
msgid "I've decided how I'll use it."
msgstr "Ya decidí en que lo gastaré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "Is that so? Well then, I'll await your decision back at Sky\\r\nFinance."
msgstr "¿En serio? Bueno, entonces, esperaré tu decisión en el Sky\\r\nFinance."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Shoko"
msgid "All right. I'll come by later."
msgstr "Bueno. Me pasaré más tarde."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "Sounds good. I'll see you there."
msgstr "Suena bien. Nos vemos allí."

